; Nemesis emission boss (round 93): the phantoms his ghosts throw at you when they shove you
; back inside. Vanilla's phantom (m_phantom.ltx) with no contact damage: the psy damage is the
; mod's own small hit. Counted by phantom_manager like the game's own dynamic phantoms.
[nemesis_phantom]:m_phantom
visuals                 = monsters\phantom\zombi_0, monsters\phantom\krovosos_0, monsters\phantom\snork_0
contact_hit             = 0
; Round 130 (owner's play test: one kept drifting after you forever): vanilla's phantom flies at
; 0.5 m/s and only ends when it touches you (xray-monolith phantom.cpp, CPhantom::OnFlyState: the
; centres within both radii), so while you move it never arrives. 8 m/s outruns a sprint; turning
; at 8 rad/s its turning circle has a 1 m radius (speed / angular_speed), inside the touch distance,
; so it cannot circle you either.
speed                   = 8
angular_speed           = 8
script_binding          = phantom_manager.bind_phantom
